  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction sphere (Explosive Orb (blast shape)), Warp sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When teleporting yourself, you may increase the casting time by one step and spend a spell point to target your destination square with a destructive blast with the Explosive Orb blast shape, paying additional costs for the destructive blast as normal. You must have line of sight and line of effect to the target square unless you possess the Unseeing Teleport talent. You may exclude your destination square from this effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/destruction#toc149\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
